{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17651","headline":"寒食宴城北山池即故郡守荣阳郑钢目爲折柳亭 · 羊士谔","name":"寒食宴城北山池即故郡守荣阳郑钢目爲折柳亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"别馆青山郭，游人折柳行。\n落花经上巳，细雨带清明。\n鶗鴂流芳暗，鸳鸯曲水平。\n归心何处醉，宝瑟有余声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"羊士谔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17651.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17651","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}